## Subdirectory Checklist

The `security/` subdirectory requires `__init__.py`:

```bash
ssh root@68.183.168.75 "ls /opt/clinical-sovereignty-lab/backend/app/services/security/__init__.py"
```

If missing: `ssh root@68.183.168.75 "touch /opt/clinical-sovereignty-lab/backend/app/services/security/__init__.py"`
